---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_cancelled: investor calls withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled()
    q_check_cancelled --> q_error_not_cancelled: saleCancelled == false
    q_error_not_cancelled --> [*]: revert SaleNotCancelled
    q_check_cancelled --> q_check_balance: saleCancelled == true
    q_check_balance --> q_error_zero: position.investedCapital == 0
    q_error_zero --> [*]: revert NoInvestedCapital
    q_check_balance --> q_check_withdrawn: position.investedCapital > 0
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_error_withdrawn: position.refunded == true
    q_error_withdrawn --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_check_withdrawn --> q_transfer: position.refunded == false
    q_transfer --> q_update: transfer position.investedCapital of bidToken to investor
    q_update --> q_emit: position.refunded = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit InvestedCapitalWithdrawn(investor, position.investedCapital)

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: Refund returns full investedCapital amount to investor
        INV-002: Each investor can refund exactly once (refunded flag)
        INV-003: Only available when saleCancelled == true
    end note
